OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fbright evening. Then a dry night with
OL,7,Fsome clear spells, though some patchy
OL,8,Flow cloud is likely to develop in the
OL,9,Feast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FA mainly dry bright day
OL,12,Fwith some sunny spells. One or two
OL,13,Fbrief showers are possible in the
OL,14,Fwest. A very warm day.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,17,FThursday will be bright and hot.
OL,18,FFriday and Saturday cloudier, mainly
OL,19,Fdry but the odd shower, less warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
